// v4.4.0: course-page CSP setting.
$string['settings:csp_course_pages_mode'] = 'Content-Security-Policy ci xëti njàng yi';
$string['settings:csp_course_pages_mode_desc'] = 'Header CSP bu ñu mën a bàyyi ci xëti njàng yi fu widget AI Course Assistant bi di dox. <strong>Tëj</strong>: amul header (default). <strong>Wone rekk</strong>: yónni <code>Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only</code> — navigateur yi dañuy bind jéyya yi waaye duñu tëj dara. Baax na ngir benn ayu-bes bu xool. <strong>Sàmm</strong>: yónni <code>Content-Security-Policy</code> — navigateur yi dañuy tëj source iframe yi nekkul ci liste bi, fetch yi, ak yeneen yóbbu yu am jafe-jafe. Dafay wàññi lu bon lu skript yu ñu duggal ci Additional HTML ci konfigirasioŋ sit bi mën a def (jafe-jafe bu IBL AI / Raison ci 2026-04-29). Du laal endpoint yu [[tutorshort]], yooyu dañuy yónni CSP bu gën a dëgër saa su nekk.';
