$string['settings:vendor_dpa_overrides'] = 'Soppi Vendor DPA (JSON)';
$string['settings:vendor_dpa_overrides_desc'] = 'JSON object keyed by vendor id. Each value is an object whose fields override the hardcoded vendor row. Fields you do not specify fall through to the default. A new vendor key in the override is added to the table; edits apply per field. Malformed JSON is ignored at runtime — fix the parse error here when the saved value does not appear in the Vendor DPA page.';
$string['settings:rate_card_overrides'] = 'Soppi taabalu njëg bu LLM (JSON)';
$string['settings:rate_card_overrides_desc'] = 'Objet JSON bu ñu caabile ci préfixe tur modèle. Kenn-kenn valeur mooy <code>{"input": float, "output": float}</code> ci USD ci 1.000.000 tokens. Day wuutu rangée rate card bi ñu yónn ngir préfixe boobu. Misaal: <pre>{ "gpt-4o-mini": { "input": 0.15, "output": 0.60 }, "claude-sonnet-4.6": { "input": 3.00, "output": 15.00 } }</pre> Jàng rekk ci v7.4.0: ñu koy boole ba tey (ci kaw baseline bi ñu yónn, ci suuf registre modèle bi) noonu benn override bu am day sax di dox, waaye dara bindul ci moom ba tey te njëg yu bees war a nekk ci registre modèle bi, bi bind ku defal kenn-kenn njëg ak kañ. Refresh bu ayubés bi daan wuutu champ bii bépp, di tas njëg yépp yu ñu bind ak loxo ci dox bi ci topp.';

