$string['email_unsubscribe:done_body'] = 'Jëf — {$a->email} dina wuute jàpp xeetu email bii jóge {$a->product}. Su nga bëggoon sopi miñ maa, laaj administrateur {$a->product} ngir ubbi abonnement bi ci kanam, walla yónniy benn consentement bu bees ci xët [[tutorshort]] Recipients.';
