$string['settingspage:rag_explainer'] = 'RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) dafay indekse kontenu bu sa njàng te dafay wut passage yu jaadu bu jàngkat yi laajee, ngir AI bi mën a joxe tontu yu tegu ci say jumtukaay. Dafa soxla benn caabiu API bu duggal (OpenAI lañu digal). Bu ko ubbee, jëfandikool xëtu RAG Admin bi ngir indekse njàng yi.';
